    "multi_move_material_accounting": "Explain the net result after checks, intermediate moves, exchanges, and recaptures rather than the first capture alone.",
    "opening_purpose": "Explain the first meaningful opening decision through development, king safety, central control, or a concrete thematic break—not memorized theory alone.",
