    "queen_safety_or_greedy_capture": "A queen capture, raid, or check loses time or material to a verified reply.",
    "rook_activity_coordination": "An active rook, invasion, doubled-rook file, or coordinated rank is more important than a pawn grab or passive defense.",
    "unpunished_opponent_opportunity": "The player's move was unsound even though the opponent missed the refutation; show both what could have happened and what actually happened.",
    "zwischenzug_or_move_order": "An intermediate check, capture, or threat changes the result before the expected recapture."
  },
